    feat(review): wire audit_multi cross-model convergence into /moai review verdict step
    
    Add Phase 3.5 to the review workflow: when audit_model selects
    cross-backend convergence, the sync-auditor reviewer folds its verdict
    through mcp__moai__audit_multi (codex/glm parallel + claude fusion) per
    the moai-ref-cross-model-audit usage SSOT. Fail-open: inconclusive or
    absent backends keep the existing single-model path; --lean skips
    (no verdict to converge); --deep keeps its own adversarial panel.
    Guarded by TestReviewWorkflowCrossModelConvergenceWiring in both trees.

